{
"file": 54,
"paths": [
"d007/d000/f131"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "014b5ab7",
"en_raw": "Those guys know nothing"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ce551865",
"en_raw": "about that place"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "ea886df1",
"en_raw": "Those guys are finished this time"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "0a594e7d",
"en_raw": "May the evil spirits drag them"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "f6192048",
"en_raw": "into eternal darkness"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "8b80666f",
"en_raw": "Somehow, you seem"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "e18e4e53",
"en_raw": "happy today"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "be9adbe5",
"en_raw": "Seem? Today is the best"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "ccb7dd92",
"en_raw": "What happened?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "c50ebe34",
"en_raw": "Heh heh, want to hear?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "95d38282",
"en_raw": "Yeah, well, a little..."
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "b751f45a",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kume"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "98e15482",
"en_raw": "about what you said before..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "f55968ef",
"en_raw": "Oh..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "5a7a99c1",
"en_raw": "I'll tell you as many times as you like"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "b53ff1c6",
"en_raw": "I'm in a really good mood today..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "b751f45a",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kume"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "6150bdc3",
"en_raw": "The redevelopment site..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "371c1df8",
"en_raw": "Shh..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "5945ad8e",
"en_raw": "Murase, it's better not to"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "8e1715ad",
"en_raw": "speak of that"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "9e646844",
"en_raw": "if you value yourself, especially"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "4c473aef",
"en_raw": "A forbidden realm"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "365e25ac",
"en_raw": "Those idiots will finally"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "db27f259",
"en_raw": "set foot in it"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a95af192",
"en_raw": "Murase, you probably won't"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "3ff8a848",
"en_raw": "see Yuasa and them anymore"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "89026847",
"en_raw": "Yuasa and them... a forbidden realm?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "985209b4",
"en_raw": "The Tama redevelopment site"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "cd359316",
"en_raw": "What madness was once"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d34a24e6",
"en_raw": "carried out in that place"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "b746c27f",
"en_raw": "...All sorts of human experiments"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "9a0cba3b",
"en_raw": "...The boiler room that burned the corpses"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "f09f1740",
"en_raw": "...Frequent accidents involving children"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "d4719dc3",
"en_raw": "I can still hear the evil spirits'"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "9e61fed8",
"en_raw": "moans"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "3cbcf310",
"en_raw": "Is that true?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "8bcadd48",
"en_raw": "The only fools who walk into a place like that"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "8d8cf906",
"en_raw": "on their own are Yuasa and his gang"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "60378193",
"en_raw": "But they can't get in there"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "662cf066",
"en_raw": "anyway..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "ac3301ae",
"en_raw": "Oh, that's odd"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "a25c2546",
"en_raw": "Don't you"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "a645940f",
"en_raw": "dislike Yuasa and them?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "94fa781d",
"en_raw": "Well, yes, but..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "1178ff37",
"en_raw": "Then you ought to look"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "fa88eda3",
"en_raw": "happier"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "f3ada7e6",
"en_raw": "You won't see them again, you know"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "60caa101",
"en_raw": "Yeah, you're right"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "cef164b9",
"en_raw": "Silence is wise"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "50a3cebb",
"en_raw": "There are worlds ordinary people can't touch"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "74808288",
"en_raw": "and they surely exist..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "14632f1b",
"en_raw": "Murase, you're kind"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "a04a7040",
"en_raw": "...But that can also be called"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "7794e590",
"en_raw": "cowardice"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "e1eeb691",
"en_raw": "If this story leaks"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "33e415ed",
"en_raw": "to Yuasa and them..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "60126a5f",
"en_raw": "I can't say what would"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "bae92659",
"en_raw": "happen to you"
}
]
}